{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01692",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 7.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Okay, doctor, we're all set in here. I'll give you the numbers when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.33,
      "end_seconds": 13.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Thanks. Hello, come in, sit down. What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.06,
      "end_seconds": 22.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "Doctor, um, it's burning on passing urine. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.04,
      "end_seconds": 27.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.02,
      "end_seconds": 38.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.08,
      "text": "Oh, it's been two months, I'm fairly sure. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.99,
      "end_seconds": 42.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.3,
      "end_seconds": 46.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Honestly, a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.08,
      "end_seconds": 50.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.57,
      "end_seconds": 66.21,
      "duration_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "A dull low backache goes along with it, most of the time. Yeah, um, the dull low backache? That's been for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 81.18,
      "end_seconds": 93.12,
      "duration_seconds": 11.94,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Respiratory rate 17, blood pressure 123 over 68. Temperature is 38.8 degrees, pulse is 98 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.18,
      "end_seconds": 95.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.45,
      "end_seconds": 99.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.81,
      "end_seconds": 103.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.01,
      "end_seconds": 124.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "There is mild tenderness above the pubic bone and no tenderness in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.61,
      "end_seconds": 130.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "You can relax now. Any sign of severe back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.05,
      "end_seconds": 135.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Nope, no severe back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.33,
      "end_seconds": 142.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Have you noticed leaking fluid, reduced baby movements or vaginal bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.29,
      "end_seconds": 153.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "I haven't had leaking fluid, reduced baby movements or vaginal bleeding, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.85,
      "end_seconds": 158.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.44,
      "end_seconds": 160.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.32,
      "end_seconds": 164.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.94,
      "end_seconds": 166.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.19,
      "end_seconds": 169.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.79,
      "end_seconds": 176.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Tiotropium inhaler. I take it once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.65,
      "end_seconds": 180.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.88,
      "end_seconds": 188.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "For about three months. Escitalopram, once a day for the anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.11,
      "end_seconds": 192.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.92,
      "end_seconds": 194.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.07,
      "end_seconds": 196.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.88,
      "end_seconds": 203.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.87,
      "end_seconds": 206.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.63,
      "end_seconds": 211.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.03,
      "end_seconds": 215.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.63,
      "end_seconds": 226.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.41,
      "end_seconds": 231.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.03,
      "end_seconds": 237.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.21,
      "end_seconds": 241.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Alright, is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.89,
      "end_seconds": 248.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.56,
      "end_seconds": 269.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.29,
      "end_seconds": 272.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Tramadol, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.38,
      "end_seconds": 276.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.46,
      "end_seconds": 281.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I had a varicose vein procedure last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.79,
      "end_seconds": 289.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions. Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.53,
      "end_seconds": 292.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "I, I have COPD."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.92,
      "end_seconds": 296.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.8,
      "end_seconds": 302.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I've had anxiety for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.97,
      "end_seconds": 313.42,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "Alright, COPD, that matches what I have here. So, based on the history and the examination, I'd lean towards a urinary infection in pregnancy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.45,
      "end_seconds": 318.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "I'm, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.99,
      "end_seconds": 329.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a urinary infection in pregnancy, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 343.88,
      "end_seconds": 347.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I've already done a urine dipstick, it's ready for you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.09,
      "end_seconds": 355.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "Right, thank you. I think a urine culture makes sense here, for urinary infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.21,
      "end_seconds": 357.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.92,
      "end_seconds": 381.05,
      "duration_seconds": 22.13,
      "text": "We'll begin with cefalexin, 500 milligrams, twice a day, seven days. That should help with urinary infection in pregnancy. Drink plenty of fluids and tell your midwife. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. Let's plan a check in one week. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 383.06,
      "end_seconds": 388.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "Um, you know, great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}